                    {
                        "sense_id": "5cb01313-e1ac-3b5f-8af6-3b874647fec2",
                        "entry_id": "61b58c21-babb-3e23-a374-0b877cfd174d",
                        "glosses": [
                            "a legendary people group (extinct or still living a subterranean life), builders of burial mounds and other prehistoric monuments"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "collective",
                            "feminine",
                            "inanimate",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "0d5d827c-2c07-4a85-85e1-38056c64a117",
                                "sense_id": "5cb01313-e1ac-3b5f-8af6-3b874647fec2",
                                "text": "Об этих постройках носится предание, вообще очень распространённое в Сибири, что некогда жила тут «чудь» и жила до того времени, пока не стал показываться на горах лес (белая берёза).",
                                "translation": "There is a legend – a very common one in Siberia – regarding these structures, that long ago the “Chud” lived here, and that they lived until the time when the woods (white birch) first started to grow on the mountains.",
                                "english": "There is a legend – a very common one in Siberia – regarding these structures, that long ago the “Chud” lived here, and that they lived until the time when the woods (white birch) first started to grow on the mountains."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
